{"headword":"רָצָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. be pleased with, accept favourably (</strong>NH id., <em>will, be willing;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رَضِىَ</span> (orig. <span dir=\"rtl\">و</span>) <em>be well pleased with</em>, Nö<sup>ZMG liv (1900), 155</sup>; Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">רצֿו</span> <em>favour</em> CIS <sup>iv. no. 77, 9 al.</sup>, cf. Hom<sup>Südar. Chrest. 123</sup>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רצֿים</span> <em>good, acceptable</em>, CIS <sup>iv, no. 73, 9. al.</sup>, of a coin, <em>good</em>, id.<sup>ib. no. 21, 5</sup>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܪܥܳܐ רְעָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܪܥܳܐ</span> <em>have pleasure in</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָעָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_רָעָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">II. רָעָה</a> supr.<strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.7\">Ec 9:7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָצָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.10\">Je 14:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.1\">1</a> s. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְרָצִאתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.27\">Ez 43:27</a> consec. (metapl. Ges<sup>§ 75 rr</sup>; Aramaism, Krae; but Co <span dir=\"rtl\">וְרָצִיתִי</span>), etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְצֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:10\" href=\"/Psalms.147.10\">ψ 147:10</a> +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְצְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:8\" href=\"/Malachi.1.8\">Mal 1:8</a>; 3 fs. juss. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּ֫רֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:43\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.43\">Lv 26:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.3\">3</a> fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּרְצֶנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.26\">Pr 23:26</a> Kt (< Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּצֹּרְנָה</span>, √ <span dir=\"rtl\">נצר</span>, cf. Toy), etc.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְצֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:14\" href=\"/Psalms.40.14\">ψ 40:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:108\" href=\"/Psalms.119.108\">119:108</a>; inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְצוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.7\">Pr 16:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:8\" href=\"/Psalms.77.8\">ψ 77:8</a>, etc.; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">רוֹצֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:11\" href=\"/Psalms.147.11\">147:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:4\" href=\"/Psalms.149.4\">149:4</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹצָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.12\">Je 14:12</a>; pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָצוּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 10:3\" href=\"/Esther.10.3\">Est 10:3</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְצוּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.24\">Dt 33:24</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be pleased with, favourable to:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of God, c. acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.1\">Is 42:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:4\" href=\"/Psalms.44.4\">ψ 44:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:11\" href=\"/Psalms.147.11\">147:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 33:26\" href=\"/Job.33.26\">Jb 33:26</a>; c. acc. rei <a data-ref=\"Psalms 85:2\" href=\"/Psalms.85.2\">ψ 85:2</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.17\">1 Ch 29:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.7\">Pr 16:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.7\">Ec 9:7</a>; c. ב pers. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:4\" href=\"/Psalms.149.4\">ψ 149:4</a>; ב rei <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:10\" href=\"/Psalms.147.10\">147:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:8\" href=\"/Haggai.1.8\">Hg 1:8</a>; abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:8\" href=\"/Psalms.77.8\">ψ 77:8</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of men: c. acc. pers., subj. father <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:8\" href=\"/Malachi.1.8\">Mal 1:8</a>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אהב</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.12\">Pr 3:12</a>; of brother <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:10\" href=\"/Genesis.33.10\">Gn 33:10</